  "lrc": "[by:Generated using Lyrically API]\n[00:05.347]I have this thing where I get older, but just never wiser\n[00:10.245]Midnights become my afternoons\n[00:15.209]When my depression works the graveyard shift\n[00:18.412]All of the people I've ghosted stand there in the room\n[00:24.515]I should not be left to my own devices\n[00:27.947]They come with prices and vices, I end up in crisis\n[00:32.282]Tale as old as time",
